## Rules

- Answers hidden in `<details>` spoiler blocks.
- Each answer includes a brief explanation.
- Tests follow the "snowball" principle — include questions from earlier lessons too.
- Self-assessment rubric at the end.
- Files: `README.md` only (no check.sh needed).
